<h2>Sinkronisasi ke PRP2 Sumut</h2><p class="muted">Tinjau dan setujui setiap versi. Versi berikutnya menunggu versi sebelumnya diterima. Pengiriman berjalan melalui worker CLI yang dijadwalkan pada server.</p><div class="notice">Status pengirim: <?= $this->config->item('pemkab_sync')['enabled']?'Diaktifkan':'Belum diaktifkan' ?>. Instalasi: <?= $esc($inst['installation_id']) ?>. API penerima Sumut harus mengikuti kontrak versi 1.0.</div>
<div class="panel table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Entitas / event</th><th>Versi</th><th>Status</th><th>Percobaan</th><th>Keterangan</th><th>Tindakan</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($events as $e): ?><tr><td><?= $esc($e['entity_type']) ?><br><small><?= $esc($e['event_id']) ?></small></td><td><?= $e['source_version'] ?></td><td><span class="badge"><?= $esc($e['status']) ?></span></td><td><?= $e['attempts'] ?></td><td><?= $esc($e['last_error']) ?></td><td><a href="<?= $url('review/'.$e['id']) ?>">Tinjau versi</a></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><h3>Riwayat percobaan terakhir</h3><div class="panel table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Waktu UTC</th><th>Event</th><th>Hasil</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($attempts as $a): ?><tr><td><?= $esc($a['attempted_at']) ?></td><td><?= $esc($a['event_id']) ?></td><td><?= $esc($a['message']) ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div>
